{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1417211-requiem-for-rome-chronicle","id":1417211,"title":"Requiem for Rome chronicle","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-07T16:12:57-07:00","id":1417211,"title":"Requiem for Rome chronicle","content":"I have started storytelling Requiem for Rome based in Vampire the Requiem first edition. I opened the submissions for my chronicle in an Spanish forum and I have received so many that I have been forced to split the players in two coteries. We have started playing Fall of the Camarilla, adding some new chapters of my own creation. I also wrote some aids, translations and characters references to let the players make contacts and allies of the main storyteller characters. Take a look:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://webvampiro.com/foro/viewforum.php?f=347\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://webvampiro.com/foro/styles/Graphit/theme/images/nuevologoinversodefintiivo.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://webvampiro.com/foro/viewforum.php?f=347\" target=\"_blank\"> FALL OF THE CAMARILLA - Webvampiro </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://webvampiro.com/foro/viewforum.php?f=347\" target=\"_blank\"> https://webvampiro.com/foro/viewforum.php?f=347 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24202-justycar","name":"Justycar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24202_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"320"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-11T03:49:00-08:00","id":1431811,"title":"","content":"Having played 13 game sessions we have almost finished Fall of the Camarilla. What a wonderful chronicle, I have enjoyed so much storytelling Rome and Requiem and the evolution of so many characters. We are near the end and I can say, after 15 years roleplaying, that this chronicle is my favorite. I let you link to the YouTube streamed videos, enjoy.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7EAnYZQxKSI&amp;list=PLVGcd1SV5iv5xcmkZGSYWTSGQ60RyiOr0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7EAn...YWTSGQ60RyiOr0</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24202-justycar","name":"Justycar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24202_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"320"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-25T12:51:13-08:00","id":1433422,"title":"","content":"Very cool. You really seem to have provided your players quite a lot of context and resources - wish I knew Spanish so that I could understand the videos!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/358-emanantvolition","name":"EmanantVolition","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar358_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}